# Shared .gitignore for the projects on this box.
#
# Copy into a project directory before its first commit (see onboard.sh), or
# merge the relevant parts into a .gitignore the project already has.
#
# The rule this file exists to enforce: git history is permanent. A credential
# committed once is readable by anyone who can clone, forever, even after it is
# deleted in a later commit — so the exclusion has to happen *before* the first
# commit, not after.

# --- credentials ---
# Every service on this box keeps its secrets in a 0600 .env owned by its own
# account. There are 14 of them and several hold spendable provider keys:
# llmproxy and wbot alone can spend money. None of them belong in git.
.env
.env.*
# ...except the sanitized templates, which document the variables without
# values and are worth committing.
!.env.example

# Private keys. Three exist on this box:
#   backup_manager/archived_keys/wma_w_inbox_li_key.key
#   personal_casino/casino_secret.key
#   wmon/monitoring_master_key.key
*.key
*.pem
*.key.pub
!*.pub

# SSH material, in case any project grows one
id_rsa
id_ed25519
id_ecdsa
*.ppk
.netrc
auth.json
*credentials*
*secret*

# --- databases ---
# These are runtime state, not source. Several are large:
#   apple_health/health.db      119 MB
#   server-predb/predb.sqlite   124 MB with nfos
# A committed database also means every future commit stores a full copy of
# every row ever written.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-*
*.sql.gz

# --- pre-existing backups ---
# Ten of these were already on the box before this file existed, from the
# 2026-09-27/28 migration work. They are copies of files that are either in
# the repo already (a stale .py.bak) or deliberately excluded (a 2.6 MB
# wrss.db.bak). Git is the history mechanism now; keeping dated copies of it
# alongside it is duplication that gets committed forever.
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak-*
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
*.rej

# --- runtime data ---
*.log
logs/
data/
traces/
nfos/
*.pid
*.sock

# --- python ---
venv/
.venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# --- node ---
node_modules/
.next/
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- editors / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
AGENTS.md
